    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate destination for adrenaline-pumping martial arts action! Step into the dojo and unleash your skills in a fast-paced, action-packed karate video game that brings the thrill of combat to your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned black belt or a beginner looking to master powerful techniques, our game offers dynamic fights, stunning visuals, and immersive game-play. Train, fight, and rise through the ranks to become the ultimate karate champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your strength and strategy? The battle begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the Godot Engine.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate destination for adrenaline-pumping martial arts action! Step into the dojo and unleash your skills in a fast-paced, action-packed karate video game that brings the thrill of combat to your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned black belt or a beginner looking to master powerful techniques, our game offers dynamic fights, stunning visuals, and immersive game-play. Train, fight, and rise through the ranks to become the ultimate karate champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your strength and strategy? The battle begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the Godot Engine.</p>",
